---
import PixelBoat from "./PixelBoat.astro";
import Scene from "./Scene.astro";
---

<section class="bp-section legs">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="bp-head bp-reveal">
      <h2>One command, three legs</h2>
      <p class="bp-sub">
        <code>boatparty cheers -- npm test</code> syncs, runs and copies back in one go. The
        sandbox stays warm for the next command.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legs__grid">
      <article class="bp-reveal">
        <p class="bp-label">~/code/app → bp-app-1</p>
        <Scene seed={5}>
          <div class="dock">
            <span class="chip">~/code/app</span>
            <span class="dock__pier"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="rope"></span>
          <span class="packet packet--out">thin pack</span>
          <div class="ride ride--right"><PixelBoat px={4} /></div>
        </Scene>
        <p class="bp-label legs__cmd">$ boatparty cheers -- npm test</p>
        <h3>Mirror</h3>
        <p>
          Tracked and untracked files travel as a thin Git pack; ignored files never leave. Only
          files whose content changed are rewritten, so build tools see unchanged mtimes.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bp-reveal" style="--d:0.08s">
        <p class="bp-label">bp-app-1 · ubuntu 24.04 · x86_64</p>
        <Scene seed={9}>
          <div class="term">
            <span>$ npm test -- -u</span>
            <span>PASS src/app.test.ts</span>
            <span>42 passed, 1 snapshot updated</span>
          </div>
          <span class="stream"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <div class="ride ride--mid"><PixelBoat px={4} /></div>
        </Scene>
        <p class="bp-label legs__cmd">live output · exit 0</p>
        <h3>Run</h3>
        <p>
          The command runs in the sandbox's checkout. Its output streams back byte for byte, and <code>cheers</code>
          exits with the command's own status.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bp-reveal" style="--d:0.16s">
        <p class="bp-label">bp-app-1 → ~/code/app</p>
        <Scene seed={13}>
          <div class="dock">
            <span class="chip chip--done">applied</span>
            <span class="dock__pier"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="rope"></span>
          <span class="packet packet--in">.snap patch</span>
          <div class="ride ride--right"><PixelBoat px={4} /></div>
        </Scene>
        <p class="bp-label legs__cmd">boatparty: applied the command's changes locally</p>
        <h3>Copy back</h3>
        <p>
          Files the command changed come home as a patch. If you edited the same lines meanwhile,
          nothing is touched and the patch is kept.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legs__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2.4rem;
  }

  .legs__grid article > .bp-label:first-child {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legs__cmd {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legs__grid h3 {
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
  }

  .legs__grid p:not(.bp-label) {
    color: var(--c-text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Scene pieces, positioned against the 220px scene and its waterline. */

  .dock {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--sea-top) - 44px);
    left: 7%;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .dock__pier {
    position: relative;
    width: 7rem;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--c-deep);
  }

  .dock__pier::before,
  .dock__pier::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--c-deep);
    content: "";
  }

  .dock__pier::before {
    left: 10px;
  }

  .dock__pier::after {
    right: 10px;
  }

  .chip {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem;
    background: var(--c-cobalt);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .chip--done::before {
    content: "✓ ";
  }

  .rope {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--sea-top) - 70px);
    right: 22%;
    left: 30%;
    border-top: 2px dotted var(--c-t1);
  }

  .packet {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--sea-top) - 82px);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    background: var(--c-ink);
    color: var(--c-bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .packet--out {
    animation: packet-out 3.6s steps(24) infinite;
  }

  .packet--in {
    animation: packet-in 3.6s steps(24) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes packet-out {
    from {
      left: 28%;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    80% {
      left: 60%;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    to {
      left: 60%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes packet-in {
    from {
      left: 60%;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    80% {
      left: 28%;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    to {
      left: 28%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .ride {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--sea-top) + 10px);
    transform: translateY(-100%);
    animation: ride-bob 2.2s steps(2) infinite;
  }

  .ride--right {
    right: 9%;
  }

  .ride--mid {
    left: 12%;
  }

  @keyframes ride-bob {
    50% {
      transform: translateY(calc(-100% - 2px));
    }
  }

  .term {
    position: absolute;
    top: 22px;
    right: 7%;
    display: grid;
    width: 58%;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--c-abyss);
    color: #e9ecf8;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .term span {
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: term-line 4.8s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  .term span:nth-child(2) {
    animation-name: term-line-2;
  }

  .term span:nth-child(3) {
    animation-name: term-line-3;
  }

  @keyframes term-line-2 {
    0%,
    24% {
      visibility: hidden;
    }
    25% {
      visibility: visible;
    }
  }

  @keyframes term-line-3 {
    0%,
    49% {
      visibility: hidden;
    }
    50% {
      visibility: visible;
    }
  }

  .stream {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--sea-top) - 70px);
    left: 4%;
    width: 30%;
    height: 4px;
  }

  .stream i {
    position: absolute;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--c-cobalt);
    animation: stream 1.6s steps(12) infinite;
  }

  .stream i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -0.32s; }
  .stream i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: -0.64s; }
  .stream i:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: -0.96s; }
  .stream i:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: -1.28s; }

  @keyframes stream {
    from {
      left: 100%;
    }
    to {
      left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .legs__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 3.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
